     "desc": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Customers can now conveniently open and manage a <strong>Shariah-compliant Deposit Pension Scheme (Islamic DPS)</strong> with <strong>Mutual Trust Bank (MTB)</strong> through the <strong>upay app</strong>. This secure savings product enables customers to make regular monthly deposits, which are automatically deducted from their upay account.</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Upon maturity, both the principal amount and the earned profit will be credited directly to the customer&rsquo;s upay account. Furthermore, customers can withdraw the full maturity amount, including profit, without incurring any additional charges.<br /><strong><u><br />Product Matrix:</u></strong></span></div>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.6965%;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15.75pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl63\" style=\"height: 15.75pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"21\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>TENURE IN MONTHS</strong></span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl64\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Amount</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">24</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">200</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica