rif; font-size: 12pt;\">36</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">36</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">48</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">200</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">48</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">500</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">48</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">48</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br />\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><u>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ):<br /></u></strong>1. What is upay DPS?<u></u></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">DPS (Deposit Pension Scheme) is an automated savings service offered by Mutual Trust Bank PLC through upay. You deposit a fixed amount monthly, and earn profit on maturity as per bank policy.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"2\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">What kind of DPS is this?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">This is an Islamic DPS offered to upay customers by Mutual Trust Bank PLC.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"3\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Who can open upay DPS?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Any upay active and full profile upay customer with valid ID and active mobile number.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"4\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Can I open multiple DPS plans?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Yes, multiple plans can be opened simultaneously.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"5\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">What are the deposit amounts and months?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The deposit amounts and months are given in the below table:</span></div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.6965%; height: 207px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 27px; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"80\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>TENURE IN MONTHS</strong></span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Amount</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15px;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 15px; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">24</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center; height: 15px;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">200</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15px;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 15px; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">24</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center; height: 15px;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">500</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15px;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 15px; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">24</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center; height: 15px;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">1,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15px;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 15px; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">24</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center; height: 15px;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">2,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15px;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 15px; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">36</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center; height: 15px;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">200</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15px;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 15px; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">36</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center; height: 15px;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">500</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15px;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 15px; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">36</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center; height: 15px;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">1,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15px;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 15px; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">36</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center; height: 15px;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">2,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15px;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 15px; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">48</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center; height: 15px;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">200</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15px;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 15px; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">48</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center; height: 15px;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">500</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15px;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 15px; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">48</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center; height: 15px;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">1,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15px;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"height: 15px; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">48</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center; height: 15px;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">2,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br />\r\n<ol start=\"6\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Are there any paperwork charges or processing fees?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">No physical paperwork and processing fees needed. The DPS application will be processed digitally via upay App.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"7\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">When can I withdraw the money?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">At maturity. Net maturity amount (Principal + accumulated profit - Source Tax - excise duty) will be sent to Customer&rsquo;s upay Account on maturity date through which the deposit account was opened and instalments were deposited.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"8\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">What are the profit-sharing options for early encashment?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">In the event of premature encashment, the final maturity amount will be calculated based on the following policy:</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.6965%;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 31.8569%; text-align: center;\" width=\"196\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Years of Relationship&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.7563%; text-align: center;\" width=\"393\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Encashment Rule&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 31.8569%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Less than 12 months&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.7563%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Customer will not receive any profit.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 31.8569%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">From 12 months to Less than 24 months&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.7563%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">The customer will receive return based on applied profit rate of the 12-month slab. For any remaining days, profit will be paid at the applied savings product profit rate.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 31.8569%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">From 24 months to Less than 36 months&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.7563%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">The customer will receive return based on applied profit rate of the 24-month slab. For any remaining days, profit will be paid at the applied savings product profit rate.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 31.8569%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">From 36 months to Less than 48 months&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.7563%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">The customer will receive return based on applied profit rate of the 36-month slab. For any remaining days, profit will be paid at the applied savings product profit rate.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<ol start=\"9\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Can I close DPS early?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Yes, after 3 months. Early encashment allowed with applicable charges (standard cash out rates).</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"10\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Can I cancel the DPS before 3 months?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">No, you cannot close the DPS before 3 months. After that, you may request encashment anytime. Early encashment allowed with applicable charges (standard cash out rates).</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"11\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">How will my installment be collected?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Keep sufficient balance in your upay account. Auto-debit occurs on due date. You&rsquo;ll be reminded through SMS 1 day prior to the monthly installment payment date.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If there is insufficient balance, the transaction will fail.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If it fails, upay will retry for up to 2 days.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"12\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">What happens if I don&rsquo;t pay an installment at all?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If auto debit remains unsuccessful, the installment of that particular month will be marked as a missed payment and no profit for that instalment will be considered.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"13\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Can I change my nominee information?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Yes, you can change your nominee details as and when needed.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"14\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If I input wrong nominee information, what will be the consequences?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">The responsibility of providing accurate nominee information lies entirely with the customer.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If incorrect or invalid nominee information is submitted, it may affect the settlement or claim process.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">upay will not be held responsible or liable for any issues, losses, or disputes arising due to wrong nominee details provided by the customer</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"15\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Are there any hidden or additional charges?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">No, there are no hidden or additional charges from upay or Mutual Trust Bank PLC (MTB).</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"16\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">What is the benefit of providing my E-TIN?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">If you provide your E-TIN information, a lower rate of Tax Deducted at Source (TDS) will apply to your profit:</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">- If you submit proof of income e-TIN to MTB, tax will be deducted at the rate of 10%.</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">- Otherwise, tax will be deducted at the rate of 15%</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">- You can submit your E-TIN anytime through the 'Savings' option in the upay app</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">- If you don&rsquo;t have an E-TIN, obtain it from the NBR website: https://secure.incometax.gov.bd/TINHome</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"17\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Can the terms and conditions change?</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Yes, Mutual Trust Bank PLC and upay reserves the right to change or amend the terms and conditions without prior notice.</span></li>\r\n</ul>",
     "desc bn": "<div data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"268\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">এখন উপায় অ্যাপের মাধ্যমে মিউচুয়াল ট্রাস্ট ব্যাংক (এমটিবি)-এর শরিয়াহভিত্তিক ডিপোজিট পেনশন স্কিম (ইসলামিক ডিপিএস) সহজেই খুলতে ও পরিচালনা করতে পারবেন।</span><br /><br data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"160\" /><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">এই নিরাপদ সঞ্চয় স্কিমে গ্রাহকের নির্ধারিত মাসিক কিস্তি স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে উপায় একাউন্ট থেকে কেটে নেওয়া হবে।</span><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">মেয়াদ পূর্ণ হলে মূল টাকা ও অর্জিত মুনাফা সরাসরি গ্রাহকের উপায় একাউন্টে জমা হবে।</span><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">এছাড়া, গ্রাহকরা কোনো অতিরিক্ত চার্জ ছাড়াই পুরো মেয়াদোত্তীর্ণ অর্থ (মূলধন ও মুনাফা সহ) উত্তোলন করতে পারবেন।</span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>প্রোডাক্ট ম্যাট্রিক্স</strong>&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"459\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.6965%;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 15.75pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl63\" style=\"height: 15.75pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\" height=\"21\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>TENURE IN MONTHS</strong></span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl64\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\" width=\"64\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Amount</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">24</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">200</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">24</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">500</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">24</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">24</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">36</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">200</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">36</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">500</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">36</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">36</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">48</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">200</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">48</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl66\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">500</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">48</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 17.25pt;\">\r\n<td class=\"xl65\" style=\"height: 17.25pt; width: 47.8053%; text-align: center;\" height=\"23\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">48</span></td>\r\n<td class=\"xl67\" style=\"width: 47.8079%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2,000</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br />\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>১</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>উপায়</strong><strong> </strong><strong>DPS </strong><strong>কী</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">DPS (ডিপোজিট পেনশন স্কিম) হলো একটি স্বয়ংক্রিয় সঞ্চয় সেবা, যা <strong>মিউচুয়াল</strong><strong> </strong><strong>ট্রাস্ট</strong><strong> </strong><strong>ব্যাংক</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পিএলসি</strong><strong> (</strong><strong>MTB)</strong> উপায়ের মাধ্যমে প্রদান করছে। আপনি প্রতি মাসে একটি নির্দিষ্ট অঙ্ক জমা রাখবেন এবং ব্যাংকের নীতিমালা অনুযায়ী মেয়াদ শেষে মুনাফা পাবেন।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>২</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>এটি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কী</strong><strong> </strong><strong>ধরনের</strong><strong> </strong><strong>DPS?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">এটি একটি ইসলামিক DPS, যা <strong>মিউচুয়াল</strong><strong> </strong><strong>ট্রাস্ট</strong><strong> </strong><strong>ব্যাংক</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পিএলসি</strong><strong> (</strong><strong>MTB)</strong> উপায় গ্রাহকদের জন্য অফার করেছে।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>৩</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>কে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>উপায়</strong><strong> </strong><strong>DPS </strong><strong>খুলতে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পারবেন</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">যেকোনো সক্রিয় ও পূর্ণ প্রোফাইল উপায় গ্রাহক, যার বৈধ পরিচয়পত্র ও সক্রিয় মোবাইল নম্বর রয়েছে।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>৪</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>আমি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>একাধিক</strong><strong> </strong><strong>DPS </strong><strong>প্ল্যান</strong><strong> </strong><strong>খুলতে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পারি</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">হ্যাঁ, আপনি একসঙ্গে একাধিক DPS পরিকল্পনা খুলতে পারবেন।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>৫</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>মাসিক</strong><strong> </strong><strong>জমার</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পরিমাণ</strong><strong> </strong><strong>ও</strong><strong> </strong><strong>মেয়াদ</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কত</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">নিচের সারণিতে মাস ও জমার পরিমাণ দেওয়া হলো:</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.6965%; height: 76px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.087%; text-align: center; height: 19px;\" width=\"260\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>মেয়াদ (মাস)</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.5263%; text-align: center; height: 19px;\" width=\"268\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>মাসিক জমার পরিমাণ (টাকা)</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.087%; text-align: center; height: 19px;\" width=\"260\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">২৪</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.5263%; text-align: center; height: 19px;\" width=\"268\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">২০০ / ৫০০ / ১,০০০ / ২,০০০</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.087%; text-align: center; height: 19px;\" width=\"260\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">৩৬</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.5263%; text-align: center; height: 19px;\" width=\"268\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">২০০ / ৫০০ / ১,০০০ / ২,০০০</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.087%; text-align: center; height: 19px;\" width=\"260\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">৪৮</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.5263%; text-align: center; height: 19px;\" width=\"268\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">২০০ / ৫০০ / ১,০০০ / ২,০০০</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br />\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>৬</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>কোনো</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কাগজপত্র</strong><strong> </strong><strong>বা</strong><strong> </strong><strong>প্রসেসিং</strong><strong> </strong><strong>ফি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>আছে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কি</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">না, কোনো শারীরিক কাগজপত্র বা প্রসেসিং ফি প্রয়োজন নেই। পুরো প্রক্রিয়াটি উপায় অ্যাপের মাধ্যমে ডিজিটালভাবে সম্পন্ন হবে।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>৭</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>কখন</strong><strong> </strong><strong>টাকা</strong><strong> </strong><strong>তুলতে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পারব</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">DPS এর মেয়াদ পূর্ণ হলে। মেয়াদ শেষে মোট টাকার পরিমাণ (মূলধন + মুনাফা &ndash; উৎসে কর &ndash; আবগারি শুল্ক) সরাসরি গ্রাহকের উপায় অ্যাকাউন্টে পাঠানো হবে।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>৮</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>মেয়াদ</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পূর্ণের</strong><strong> </strong><strong>আগে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>টাকা</strong><strong> </strong><strong>তুললে</strong><strong> (</strong><strong>Early Encashment) </strong><strong>মুনাফার</strong><strong> </strong><strong>নিয়ম</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কী</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">আগাম উত্তোলনের ক্ষেত্রে মুনাফা নিম্নলিখিত নীতিমালা অনুযায়ী নির্ধারিত হবে:</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.6965%;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.087%; text-align: center;\" width=\"260\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;মেয়াদ</strong></span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.5263%; text-align: center;\" width=\"268\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>উত্তোলনের নিয়ম</strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.087%; text-align: center;\" width=\"260\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">১২ মাসের কম</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.5263%; text-align: center;\" width=\"268\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">কোনো মুনাফা প্রদান করা হবে না</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.087%; text-align: center;\" width=\"260\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">১২ মাস থেকে কমপক্ষে ২৪ মাসের কম</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.5263%; text-align: center;\" width=\"268\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">১২ মাসের হারের ভিত্তিতে মুনাফা প্রদান করা হবে; অতিরিক্ত দিনের জন্য সেভিংস অ্যাকাউন্টের হারে মুনাফা দেওয়া হবে</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.087%; text-align: center;\" width=\"260\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">২৪ মাস থেকে কমপক্ষে ৩৬ মাসের কম</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.5263%; text-align: center;\" width=\"268\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">২৪ মাসের হারের ভিত্তিতে মুনাফা দেওয়া হবে; অতিরিক্ত দিনের জন্য সেভিংস অ্যাকাউন্টের হারে মুনাফা প্রদান করা হবে</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.087%; text-align: center;\" width=\"260\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">৩৬ মাস থেকে কমপক্ষে ৪৮ মাসের কম</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 48.5263%; text-align: center;\" width=\"268\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">৩৬ মাসের হারের ভিত্তিতে মুনাফা দেওয়া হবে; অতিরিক্ত দিনের জন্য সেভিংস অ্যাকাউন্টের হারে মুনাফা দেওয়া হবে</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br />\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>৯</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>আমি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>DPS </strong><strong>আগে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>বন্ধ</strong><strong> </strong><strong>করতে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পারব</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">হ্যাঁ, ৩ মাস পর থেকে DPS আগাম বন্ধ করা যাবে, প্রযোজ্য চার্জ (স্ট্যান্ডার্ড ক্যাশ আউট রেট) কেটে নেওয়া হবে।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>১০</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>আমি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>৩</strong><strong> </strong><strong>মাসের</strong><strong> </strong><strong>আগে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>DPS </strong><strong>বাতিল</strong><strong> </strong><strong>করতে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পারব</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">না, ৩ মাসের আগে DPS বন্ধ করা যাবে না। ৩ মাস পর যেকোনো সময় আগাম উত্তোলনের আবেদন করা যাবে।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>১১</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>কিস্তি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কীভাবে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পরিশোধ</strong><strong> </strong><strong>হবে</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">আপনার উপায় অ্যাকাউন্টে পর্যাপ্ত ব্যালেন্স রাখুন। নির্ধারিত তারিখে স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে (auto debit) টাকা কেটে নেওয়া হবে।</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">কিস্তির ১ দিন আগে SMS এর মাধ্যমে মনে করিয়ে দেওয়া হবে।</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">ব্যালেন্স অপর্যাপ্ত থাকলে কিস্তি ব্যর্থ হবে, এবং উপায় সর্বোচ্চ ২ দিন পর্যন্ত পুনরায় চেষ্টা করবে।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>১২</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>যদি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কোনো</strong><strong> </strong><strong>মাসের</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কিস্তি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পরিশোধ</strong><strong> </strong><strong>না</strong><strong> </strong><strong>হয়</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">নির্ধারিত সময়েও কিস্তি ব্যর্থ হলে, সেই মাসের কিস্তিকে &lsquo;মিসড&rsquo; হিসেবে চিহ্নিত করা হবে এবং ঐ কিস্তির জন্য কোনো মুনাফা গণনা করা হবে না।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>১৩</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>আমি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>নমিনি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পরিবর্তন</strong><strong> </strong><strong>করতে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পারব</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">হ্যাঁ, আপনি যেকোনো সময় আপনার নমিনি তথ্য পরিবর্তন করতে পারবেন।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>১৪</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>ভুল</strong><strong> </strong><strong>নমিনি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>তথ্য</strong><strong> </strong><strong>দিলে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কী</strong><strong> </strong><strong>হবে</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">সঠিক নমিনি তথ্য প্রদান করার দায়িত্ব সম্পূর্ণ গ্রাহকের।</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">ভুল বা অবৈধ নমিনি তথ্য দিলে, সেটি নিষ্পত্তি বা দাবি প্রক্রিয়ায় প্রভাব ফেলতে পারে।</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">ভুল নমিনি তথ্যের কারণে কোনো ক্ষতি বা বিরোধ দেখা দিলে উপায় দায়ী থাকবে না।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>১৫</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>কোনো</strong><strong> </strong><strong>গোপন</strong><strong> </strong><strong>বা</strong><strong> </strong><strong>অতিরিক্ত</strong><strong> </strong><strong>চার্জ</strong><strong> </strong><strong>আছে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কি</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">না, উপায় বা <strong>মিউচুয়াল</strong><strong> </strong><strong>ট্রাস্ট</strong><strong> </strong><strong>ব্যাংক</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পিএলসি</strong><strong> (</strong><strong>MTB)</strong> এর পক্ষ থেকে কোনো গোপন বা অতিরিক্ত চার্জ নেই।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>১৬</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>E-TIN </strong><strong>প্রদান</strong><strong> </strong><strong>করলে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কী</strong><strong> </strong><strong>সুবিধা</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পাব</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">E-TIN তথ্য দিলে মুনাফার ওপর কম হারে উৎসে কর (TDS) প্রযোজ্য হবে:</span></li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">E-TIN জমা দিলে কর কাটা হবে ১০% হারে।</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">E-TIN না থাকলে কর কাটা হবে ১৫% হারে।</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">আপনি যেকোনো সময় উপায় অ্যাপের &ldquo;Savings&rdquo; অপশন থেকে E-TIN আপলোড করতে পারবেন।</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">যদি E-TIN না থাকে, তাহলে জাতীয় রাজস্ব বোর্ডের ওয়েবসাইট থেকে সংগ্রহ করুন: <a href=\"https://secure.incometax.gov.bd/TINHome\">https://secure.incometax.gov.bd/TINHome</a></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>১৭</strong><strong>. </strong><strong>শর্তাবলি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>কি</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পরিবর্তন</strong><strong> </strong><strong>হতে</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পারে</strong><strong>?</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">হ্যাঁ, <strong>মিউচুয়াল</strong><strong> </strong><strong>ট্রাস্ট</strong><strong> </strong><strong>ব্যাংক</strong><strong> </strong><strong>পিএলসি</strong><strong> (</strong><strong>MTB)</strong> এবং <strong>উপায়</strong> প্রয়োজন অনুযায়ী পূর্ব ঘোষণা ছাড়াই শর্তাবলি পরিবর্তন বা সংশোধন করার অধিকার রাখে।</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>",
     "Methods": [
